    "Expert-authored scientific claims, not production queries.",
    "Incomplete relevance judgments; evidence can support or refute a claim.",
    "Pretraining contamination unknown; official splits may share source papers.",
    "Generic MS MARCO reranker receives no SciFact fine-tuning.",
